Package: libpicod
Architecture: {{arch}}
Description: Tools and libraries to interact with picod boards
 The picod firmware runs on a Raspberry Pi Pico board and appears on Linux
 as a USB serial device.
 .
 This package provides a tool (picodcmd) and a library (libpicod) that can
 be used to interact with the picod firmware.

